                                "sense_id": "99697ee6-f8c0-38c0-bd0f-844f528e3807",
                                "text": "De piloten staan klaar op het vliegdek om hun vliegtuigen te laten opstijgen.",
                                "translation": "The pilots are ready on the flight deck to launch their airplanes.",
                                "english": "The pilots are ready on the flight deck to launch their airplanes."
